  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multisectoral relief assistance in Gaza</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide displaced families with access to basic supply of food, nutrition, water, sanitation, hygiene, and non-food items they need to survive.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling - Emergency multisectoral response until June 2025 in spontaneous displacement sites and collective centers in Khan Younis, Deir al Balah, Gaza and North Gaza Governorates. Includes in-kind food &amp; non-food assistance, Nutrition and WASH.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Total Participants : 77000. The beneficiaries fall under the following descriptions : Female-headed households  ;Child-headed households  ;Separated, divorced, or widowed women; Elderly-headed households with no other source of income.</narrative>
  </description>
